{"line":"T43.U.01","text":"Ich würde es anders ausdrücken. Ich kenne viele, die Englisch sprechen. Du schreibst wie sie. Aber ich sehe Filme, indem ich ins Kino gehe, und du siehst sie, indem du liest, was die Welt über sie geschrieben hat. Menschen sind darauf geprägt, die Art, wie jemand Sprache benutzt, als Einblick in sein Denken zu nehmen. Ich kann meine Frau nicht genau wissen lassen, was ich denke, weil Sprache ein so verlustbehafteter Kanal mit so geringer Bandbreite ist, obwohl wir uns seit Jahrzehnten kennen. Aber ich weiß, wie es ist, in meinem Kopf zu sein.","lufs":-17.1,"alignment":{"characters":["I","c","h"," ","w","ü","r","d","e"," ","e","s"," ","a","n","d","e","r","s"," ","a","u","s","d","r","ü","c","k","e","n","."," ","I","c","h"," ","k","e","n","n","e"," ","v","i","e","l","e",","," ","d","i","e"," ","E","n","g","l","i","s","c","h"," ","s","p","r","e","c","h","e","n","."," ","D","u"," ","s","c","h","r","e","i","b","s","t"," ","w","i","e"," ","s","i","e","."," ","A","b","e","r"," ","i","c","h"," ","s","e","h","e"," ","F","i","l","m","e",","," ","i","n","d","e","m"," ","i","c","h"," ","i","n","s"," ","K","i","n","o"," ","g","e","h","e",","," ","u","n","d"," ","d","u"," ","s","i","e","h","s","t"," ","s","i","e",","," ","i","n","d","e","m"," ","d","u"," ","l","i","e","s","t",","," ","w","a","s"," ","d","i","e"," ","W","e","l","t"," ","ü","b","e","r"," ","s","i","e"," ","g","e","s","c","h","r","i","e","b","e","n"," ","h","a","t","."," ","M","e","n","s","c","h","e","n"," ","s","i","n","d"," ","d","a","r","a","u","f"," ","g","e","p","r","ä","g","t",","," ","d","i","e"," ","A","r","t",","," ","w","i","e"," ","j","e","m","a","n","d"," ","S","p","r","a","c","h","e"," ","b","e","n","u","t","z","t",","," ","a","l","s"," ","E","i","n","b","l","i","c","k"," ","i","n"," ","s","e","i","n"," ","D","e","n","k","e","n"," ","z","u"," ","n","e","h","m","e","n","."," ","I","c","h"," ","k","a","n","n"," ","m","e","i","n","e"," ","F","r","a","u"," ","n","i","c","h","t"," "